1
00:01:03,800 --> 00:01:07,080
[Fragments of Truth]

2
00:01:07,080 --> 00:01:08,600
[Episode 17]

3
00:01:31,840 --> 00:01:32,120
Captain Ren!

4
00:01:32,790 --> 00:01:33,640
Doctor!

5
00:01:35,040 --> 00:01:35,790
Doctor!

6
00:01:37,950 --> 00:01:39,590
The patient is safe for now.

7
00:01:41,000 --> 00:01:42,590
A traumatic cerebral hemorrhage

8
00:01:42,950 --> 00:01:44,790
can cause severe brain damage.

9
00:01:44,950 --> 00:01:47,760
It will take at least a week

10
00:01:47,790 --> 00:01:49,000
for him to fully regain consciousness.

11
00:01:50,040 --> 00:01:51,840
Even if he does wake up,

12
00:01:52,230 --> 00:01:53,760
he may suffer lasting effects.

13
00:01:53,840 --> 00:01:55,000
It's his brain, after all.

14
00:02:05,230 --> 00:02:07,200
Captain Ren, don't worry too much.

15
00:02:07,920 --> 00:02:09,000
The doctors will do everything they can.

16
00:02:11,310 --> 00:02:12,240
Dr. Wang!
Dr. Wang!

17
00:02:12,360 --> 00:02:13,840
The patient's test results are in.

18
00:02:20,750 --> 00:02:23,590
Doctor, is something wrong?

19
00:02:24,910 --> 00:02:26,430
We found a chemical substance

20
00:02:26,430 --> 00:02:28,000
in the patient's blood.

21
00:02:28,590 --> 00:02:29,800
Its concentration is very high.

22
00:02:29,800 --> 00:02:33,240
He must have had prolonged exposure
to it or taken it for a long time.

23
00:02:34,190 --> 00:02:37,560
Do you know anything about it?

24
00:02:51,190 --> 00:02:53,800
We ran gas and liquid chromatography.

25
00:02:53,840 --> 00:02:55,800
We only know
it contains psychotropic compounds.

26
00:02:55,910 --> 00:02:57,590
But its exact composition is complex.

27
00:02:57,840 --> 00:02:59,400
We need further test results.

28
00:03:01,430 --> 00:03:03,190
That bottle Han Ning always carried...

29
00:03:03,190 --> 00:03:05,000
I remember the brand on it was

30
00:03:05,120 --> 00:03:05,800
Tai'anmei.

31
00:03:06,190 --> 00:03:07,840
It's a health supplement
that calms the nerves and aids sleep.

32
00:03:08,750 --> 00:03:11,360
But what was inside was something else.

33
00:03:12,310 --> 00:03:13,430
Why would he take that?

34
00:03:13,840 --> 00:03:16,310
I heard he had insomnia.

35
00:03:16,560 --> 00:03:18,310
Maybe he used it as a sleep aid?

36
00:03:20,710 --> 00:03:22,190
But here's the problem.

37
00:03:22,240 --> 00:03:23,630
This psychotropic substance

38
00:03:23,630 --> 00:03:25,120
is damaging Han Ning's brain.

39
00:03:25,400 --> 00:03:27,120
The damage may be irreversible.

40
00:03:27,800 --> 00:03:28,840
My next step is

41
00:03:28,840 --> 00:03:31,000
to send it to a medical university
in the provincial capital for analysis.

42
00:03:31,030 --> 00:03:33,030
Our lab can't analyze it here.

43
00:04:06,120 --> 00:04:08,240
[Seven years ago]

44
00:04:14,840 --> 00:04:16,360
There's still no answer
in your sister's case.

45
00:04:16,950 --> 00:04:17,800
But don't worry.

46
00:04:18,390 --> 00:04:19,750
Until the case is solved,

47
00:04:19,920 --> 00:04:21,240
I'll never stop investigating.

48
00:04:26,360 --> 00:04:27,390
This is my number.

49
00:04:28,120 --> 00:04:31,190
Remember, come to me
if you ever need anything.

50
00:04:54,390 --> 00:04:56,310
You're Han Ning's guardian?

51
00:04:59,040 --> 00:04:59,510
Yes.

52
00:05:00,240 --> 00:05:02,160
Let me know if anything comes up.

53
00:05:09,720 --> 00:05:11,040
When you were little, you told me

54
00:05:12,600 --> 00:05:14,120
you wanted to be a police officer.

55
00:05:16,190 --> 00:05:17,000
You asked me

56
00:05:18,630 --> 00:05:20,750
which police academy was the best.

57
00:05:24,510 --> 00:05:26,240
I told you I didn't want you to join.

58
00:05:27,390 --> 00:05:28,720
You insisted you would.

59
00:05:29,240 --> 00:05:30,240
You said that as a police officer,

60
00:05:30,630 --> 00:05:32,040
you could bring your sister home.

61
00:05:40,310 --> 00:05:41,600
But do you know something?

62
00:05:43,190 --> 00:05:44,630
I was always afraid

63
00:05:44,630 --> 00:05:45,800
that one day, you wouldn't wake up.

64
00:05:50,240 --> 00:05:52,190
How could I face your sister?

65
00:06:09,390 --> 00:06:12,240
Uncle, when can you send me away?

66
00:06:13,240 --> 00:06:15,240
I told you not to rush.

67
00:06:16,240 --> 00:06:17,800
I don't feel safe here.

68
00:06:17,920 --> 00:06:21,040
Don't worry.
Just do as I say and don't go outside.

69
00:06:21,120 --> 00:06:22,270
The police won't find you.

70
00:06:23,920 --> 00:06:25,600
I haven't slept in a day and a night.

71
00:06:25,600 --> 00:06:26,510
I've been terrified.

72
00:06:28,000 --> 00:06:29,240
I have nothing left now.

73
00:06:29,240 --> 00:06:30,630
Uncle, can you help me?

74
00:06:32,560 --> 00:06:33,390
Who is it?

75
00:06:34,390 --> 00:06:35,240
Delivery.

76
00:06:35,950 --> 00:06:36,950
What a psycho.

77
00:06:42,070 --> 00:06:42,720
Where is he?

78
00:09:01,510 --> 00:09:01,750
Captain Ren.

79
00:09:03,390 --> 00:09:05,320
Sun Jiahao suffered
seven or eight stab wounds in total.

80
00:09:05,320 --> 00:09:07,550
One pierced his cervical spine
and proved fatal.

81
00:09:07,960 --> 00:09:09,840
Ding Wei's throat was slit
with a single stroke.

82
00:09:10,240 --> 00:09:11,390
Judging by the wounds,

83
00:09:11,790 --> 00:09:13,840
the same weapon killed both men.
This one.

84
00:09:14,270 --> 00:09:14,870
This one?

85
00:09:20,390 --> 00:09:22,960
It appears
Ding Wei posed as a deliveryman

86
00:09:23,320 --> 00:09:25,240
to get Sun Jiahao to open the door.

87
00:09:26,240 --> 00:09:29,630
During the fight,
Sun Jiahao wrested the weapon from him

88
00:09:29,630 --> 00:09:30,600
and killed him with one strike.

89
00:09:31,630 --> 00:09:33,720
Sun Jiahao then succumbed

90
00:09:33,720 --> 00:09:35,790
to blood loss and severe injuries.

91
00:09:36,000 --> 00:09:38,910
Only their fingerprints
were found on the weapon.

92
00:09:39,440 --> 00:09:41,030
Before we arrived,

93
00:09:41,030 --> 00:09:45,000
there was no sign
that anyone else had entered the house.

94
00:09:46,840 --> 00:09:47,630
Does that make sense?

95
00:09:56,200 --> 00:09:58,200
What other explanation could there be?

96
00:10:01,320 --> 00:10:02,630
It just seems too convenient

97
00:10:02,630 --> 00:10:04,910
that Sun Jiahao and the killer
died here together.

98
00:10:05,790 --> 00:10:07,960
It's hard to believe
that was pure coincidence.

99
00:10:09,240 --> 00:10:10,270
That's true.

100
00:10:11,080 --> 00:10:12,320
A suspect even we couldn't find...

101
00:10:13,240 --> 00:10:16,550
How could an ordinary man
like Ding Wei find him?

102
00:10:19,360 --> 00:10:21,000
Unless Ding Wei

103
00:10:22,390 --> 00:10:23,600
had been following him all along.

104
00:10:28,840 --> 00:10:29,630
Oh, right.

105
00:10:30,120 --> 00:10:31,240
We made another major discovery.

106
00:10:31,550 --> 00:10:33,750
Yu Hongfei, the man we'd been seeking,

107
00:10:34,030 --> 00:10:37,000
was frozen in the kitchen freezer.

108
00:11:13,030 --> 00:11:15,480
Hello.
Are you Ding Wei's sister?

109
00:11:18,840 --> 00:11:19,630
Yes, I am.

110
00:11:52,360 --> 00:11:53,550
My dear sister,

111
00:11:53,630 --> 00:11:55,200
thank you for taking care of me
all these years.

112
00:11:56,240 --> 00:11:57,320
You once told me

113
00:11:57,390 --> 00:11:58,240
you don't like mountains,

114
00:11:58,670 --> 00:11:59,600
but you love the sea.

115
00:12:00,120 --> 00:12:01,750
Mountains block your view,

116
00:12:02,360 --> 00:12:04,080
but the sea lets you see far away.

117
00:12:04,870 --> 00:12:05,720
If it weren't for me,

118
00:12:06,000 --> 00:12:08,240
you might have moved somewhere
by the sea long ago.

119
00:12:08,960 --> 00:12:10,600
Maybe you'd have fallen in love,

120
00:12:11,080 --> 00:12:12,240
had a child,

121
00:12:13,000 --> 00:12:14,550
and grown old with them by your side.

122
00:12:15,360 --> 00:12:18,510
Or maybe you'd have focused
on doing what you love,

123
00:12:19,200 --> 00:12:22,000
living freely even on your own.

124
00:12:23,440 --> 00:12:25,960
I dragged you into a swamp

125
00:12:26,270 --> 00:12:28,720
that slowly swallowed everything,

126
00:12:28,870 --> 00:12:29,630
with no end in sight.

127
00:12:30,510 --> 00:12:31,840
That's why I have to leave.

128
00:12:32,360 --> 00:12:33,240
Don't be sad.

129
00:12:33,790 --> 00:12:35,150
Every day from now on,

130
00:12:35,320 --> 00:12:37,120
live freely for me.

131
00:12:40,440 --> 00:12:41,600
Please come with us.

132
00:13:23,920 --> 00:13:25,990
♪I stand in a fire-tempered jungle♪

133
00:13:25,990 --> 00:13:27,930
♪Withered leaves fall
as my strength runs dry♪

134
00:13:27,930 --> 00:13:29,840
♪Dust swirls as I clench my fists♪

135
00:13:29,840 --> 00:13:31,650
♪I strategize, my faith my armor♪

136
00:13:31,650 --> 00:13:33,990
♪My defiance spills onto concrete♪

137
00:13:33,990 --> 00:13:36,410
♪Even thick fog can't hide
my clear gaze♪

138
00:13:39,560 --> 00:13:41,460
♪Let neon turn to thorns♪

139
00:13:41,460 --> 00:13:43,360
♪Flying low as the stars shift and turn♪

140
00:13:43,360 --> 00:13:45,300
♪Escape the maze,
transcend the challenge♪

141
00:13:45,300 --> 00:13:47,430
♪The meter starts, breaking the silence♪

142
00:13:47,460 --> 00:13:49,440
♪A beam cuts through
a crack in the wall♪

143
00:13:49,440 --> 00:13:51,600
♪This rhythm and noise
echo through the streets♪

144
00:13:55,200 --> 00:13:58,670
♪Don't be afraid. No one will answer♪

145
00:13:58,670 --> 00:14:02,040
♪Why is that child crying?♪

146
00:14:02,280 --> 00:14:04,750
♪The shrinking scar on my arm♪

147
00:14:04,750 --> 00:14:06,360
♪Means I've grown up♪

148
00:14:06,360 --> 00:14:09,510
♪You can trust me when I say that♪

149
00:14:09,510 --> 00:14:13,000
♪The wound still aches♪

150
00:14:13,400 --> 00:14:17,760
♪Like a biting winter♪

151
00:14:17,760 --> 00:14:21,020
♪But a spark still glows♪

